<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 1.7 mln shares on market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 1.7 mln shares on market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it had bought back a further 1.7 million shares on-market on Friday, at between NZ$6.47 and $6.55 per share, as part of its NZ$1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>On Friday the shares closed up seven cents at $6.50.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
